+// Android GLES compatibility profile for ArenaMW complex PBR water.
+// Keep the complete PBR/refraction/foam/ripple lighting path, but avoid the
+// desktop FBM raymarch/analytic geometry stage that is especially fragile and
+// expensive through NG-GL4ES on tiled mobile GPUs. Animated multi-normal waves
+// below remain enabled.
